  <ProfessionalSummary>覆盖冷却水系统监测参数配置及数据接入报警系统的要求，确保满足船级社和标准规范。</ProfessionalSummary>
  <EngineeringRequirements count="2">
    <Requirement id="ER-P054-01" level="1" requirementType="monitoring">
      <sysml:Name>冷却水系统监测参数</sysml:Name>
      <sysml:Text>主机冷却水系统应在各支路配置流量计和温度传感器，用于实时监测各支路冷却水流量和温度。</sysml:Text>
      <sysml:VerifiedBy method="inspection" />
      <sysml:DerivedFrom refId="ER-P054" />
      <sysml:Traceability>
        <Evidence id="E-CTRL-COOL-002" supportStatus="verified_by_direct_evidence" />
        <Evidence id="E-ISO8861-002" supportStatus="verified_by_direct_evidence" />
        <Evidence id="E-IACS-M3-002" supportStatus="verified_by_direct_evidence" />
      </sysml:Traceability>
      <sysml:QualityStatus>
        <SupportStatus>verified_by_direct_evidence</SupportStatus>
        <RiskIfUnmet>无法实时监测冷却水参数，可能导致主机过热或冷却不足，影响安全运行。</RiskIfUnmet>
      </sysml:QualityStatus>
      <sysml:AcceptanceCriteria>
        <Criterion>检查系统图纸，确认各支路均配置流量计和温度传感器。</Criterion>
        <Criterion>调试期间验证传感器信号正常传输至监测报警系统。</Criterion>
      </sysml:AcceptanceCriteria>
      <sysml:EngineeringRationale>本条覆盖方面【冷却水系统监测参数】，来自原始需求「安装流量计和温度传感器，实时监测各支路流量和温度」。E-CTRL-COOL-002（IACS UR E10）支撑了温度传感器和流量监测（泵运行状态）的配置要求；E-ISO8861-002（ISO 8861:1998）支撑了温度监测要求；E-IACS-M3-002（IACS UR M3.1）支撑了持续监控主机冷却水温度的要求。</sysml:EngineeringRationale>
      <sysml:QualityGateReport passed="true" score="1.0">
        <Check dimension="evidence_sufficiency" passed="true" severity="error">
          <Message>Evidence present: 3 item(s), support_status='verified_by_direct_evidence'.</Message>
        </Check>
        <Check dimension="verifiability" passed="true" severity="error">
          <Message>Verifiable: method='inspection', 2 criterion/criteria defined.</Message>
        </Check>
        <Check dimension="over_inference" passed="true" severity="error">
          <Message>No over-inference detected.</Message>
        </Check>
        <Check dimension="ambiguity" passed="true" severity="warning">
          <Message>No ambiguous terms detected (LLM check).</Message>
        </Check>
        <Check dimension="mbse_completeness" passed="true" severity="error">
          <Message>All 4 SysML required fields are present.</Message>
        </Check>
      </sysml:QualityGateReport>
    </Requirement>
    <Requirement id="ER-P054-02" level="1" requirementType="alarm">
      <sysml:Name>监测数据接入报警系统</sysml:Name>
      <sysml:Text>流量计和温度传感器的测量信号应接入机舱监测报警系统，并在集控室和驾驶台显示相关参数及报警。</sysml:Text>
      <sysml:VerifiedBy method="commissioning_check" />
      <sysml:DerivedFrom refId="ER-P054" />
      <sysml:Traceability>
        <Evidence id="E-CTRL-COOL-002" supportStatus="verified_by_direct_evidence" />
        <Evidence id="E-ISO8861-002" supportStatus="verified_by_direct_evidence" />
        <Evidence id="E-SOLAS-COOL-001" supportStatus="verified_by_direct_evidence" />
      </sysml:Traceability>
      <sysml:QualityStatus>
        <SupportStatus>verified_by_direct_evidence</SupportStatus>
        <RiskIfUnmet>操作人员无法及时获知冷却水异常，可能导致主机损坏。</RiskIfUnmet>
      </sysml:QualityStatus>
      <sysml:AcceptanceCriteria>
        <Criterion>检查系统接线图，确认传感器信号接入报警系统。</Criterion>
        <Criterion>调试期间模拟温度超限和流量异常，确认报警在集控室和驾驶台正确触发。</Criterion>
      </sysml:AcceptanceCriteria>
      <sysml:EngineeringRationale>本条覆盖方面【监测数据接入报警系统】，来自原始需求「接入机舱监测报警系统」。E-CTRL-COOL-002（IACS UR E10）支撑了所有报警接入船舶报警管理系统；E-ISO8861-002（ISO 8861:1998）支撑了报警应在机控室和驾驶台显示；E-SOLAS-COOL-001（SOLAS Reg.26）支撑了温度异常时报警的要求。</sysml:EngineeringRationale>
